      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "SEEDVR2 STOCK | 7B FP16 | 1080p\n\nUpload a video in the first node, then Run. No prompt is needed.\n\nresolution = short edge; max_resolution = long-edge cap. Aspect ratio is preserved, not forced to 16:9.\n\nBatch 9 is temporal context, NOT a clip-length limit. Audio and source FPS bypass the AI.\n\nUse short SDR clips first. This stock graph keeps decoded frames in RAM; it is NOT a streaming workflow. Start with a 5-second clip, especially at 4K.\n\nFirst Run downloads only the selected 7B FP16 model and FP16 VAE. Existing matching models are reused."
      ],
      "title": "Start here"
    }
